---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Liceo Trapaqueante - Red de Ex Alumnos"
    description="Galería de ex alumnos destacados del Liceo Bicentenario Trapaqueante en las especialidades de Enfermería, Acuicultura y Científico Humanista."
>
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="bg-gray-800 py-16 border-b-4 border-liceo-yellow text-white relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523050854058-8df90110c9f1?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1950&q=80" alt="Graduación" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
        </div>
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center relative z-10">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Nuestros Ex Alumnos</h1>
            <p class="text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto text-gray-200">El mayor orgullo del Liceo Trapaqueante son las generaciones de profesionales y personas íntegras que hemos formado.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Intro -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 text-center">
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            A lo largo de los años, cientos de jóvenes de Tirúa y sus alrededores han pasado por nuestras aulas. Hoy, muchos de ellos se desempeñan exitosamente en el mundo laboral gracias a nuestras especialidades Técnico Profesionales, o continúan sus estudios en la Educación Superior. 
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-8 border-b-2 border-liceo-blue inline-block pb-2">Galería de Titulados y Egresados</h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Galería de Ex Alumnos -->
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 pb-20">
        
        <!-- Enfermería -->
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-user-nurse text-blue-500"></i> Especialidad de Enfermería</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-12">
            <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group relative">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584432810601-6c7f27d2362b?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Ex alumno enfermería" class="w-full h-64 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-4 text-white">
                    <p class="font-bold text-sm">Generación 2022</p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-300">Práctica Profesional</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group relative">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160550-2173dba999ef?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Ex alumno enfermería" class="w-full h-64 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-4 text-white">
                    <p class="font-bold text-sm">Ceremonia de Titulación</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group relative">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551076805-e1869033e561?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Ex alumno enfermería" class="w-full h-64 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-4 text-white">
                    <p class="font-bold text-sm">Generación 2020</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group relative">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1527613426441-4da17471b66d?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Ex alumno enfermería" class="w-full h-64 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-4 text-white">
                    <p class="font-bold text-sm">Equipo de Salud</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Acuicultura -->
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-water text-cyan-600"></i> Especialidad de Acuicultura</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-12">
            <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group relative">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534073737927-85f1ebff1f5d?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Ex alumno acuicultura" class="w-full h-64 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-4 text-white">
                    <p class="font-bold text-sm">Práctica en terreno</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group relative">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518557984649-7b161c230cfa?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Ex alumno acuicultura" class="w-full h-64 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-4 text-white">
                    <p class="font-bold text-sm">Generación 2023</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group relative">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522069169874-c58ec4b76be1?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Ex alumno acuicultura" class="w-full h-64 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-4 text-white">
                    <p class="font-bold text-sm">Titulación</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group relative">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606041011872-5965904dd60f?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Ex alumno acuicultura" class="w-full h-64 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-4 text-white">
                    <p class="font-bold text-sm">Laboratorio</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Científico Humanista -->
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2"><i class="fas fa-university text-liceo-red"></i> Científico Humanista</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group relative">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541339907198-e08756dedf3f?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Ex alumno HC" class="w-full h-64 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-4 text-white">
                    <p class="font-bold text-sm">Ingreso a U. Superior</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group relative">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523240795612-9a054b0db644?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Ex alumno HC" class="w-full h-64 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-4 text-white">
                    <p class="font-bold text-sm">Generación 2021</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-md group relative">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511629091441-ee46146481b6?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Ex alumno HC" class="w-full h-64 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500">
                <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent p-4 text-white">
                    <p class="font-bold text-sm">Licenciatura 4to Medio</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Llamado a Ex Alumnos -->
    <div class="bg-liceo-yellow py-12">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-liceo-blue mb-4">¿Eres Ex Alumno del Liceo Trapaqueante?</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-800 mb-6">Nos encantaría saber de ti, compartir tus fotos de tu época liceana o conocer tus logros profesionales para inspirar a las nuevas generaciones.</p>
            <a href="mailto:contacto@liceotrapaqueante.cl" class="inline-block bg-liceo-blue text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full hover:bg-blue-900 transition shadow">
                ¡Contáctanos y envía tus fotos!
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
